    "body": {
      "en": "### Week 1: Water, Cup and Drinking Routine\n\nChildren begin with water and cup routines. The focus is recognising cups, giving cups, drinking water, putting cups in the correct place, and responding to simple care language.\n\n### Week 2: Snack, Apple and Banana\n\nChildren explore snack routines with familiar fruit and food props. The focus is choosing, touching, smelling, placing food on plates, and responding to `more` and `all done` through gesture or routine participation.\n\n### Week 3: Hands, Face, Wash and Wipe\n\nChildren connect food routines with hygiene and care. The focus is washing hands, wiping mouth, showing hands, identifying clean/dirty through real care routines, and using cloths or wipes safely.\n\n### Week 4: Snack Clean-Up and Care for Others\n\nChildren integrate food, drink, hygiene, and care routines through pretend kitchen, doll care, table setting, picnic play, and clean-up. The focus is helping, giving, placing, wiping, and returning objects.",
      "zh": "### Week 1: Water, Cup and Drinking Routine｜第一周：水、杯子和喝水常规\n\n儿童从水和杯子常规开始。重点是识别杯子、给杯子、喝水、把杯子放到正确的位置，以及回应简单的照护语言。\n\n### Week 2: Snack, Apple and Banana｜第二周：点心、苹果和香蕉\n\n儿童用熟悉的水果和食物道具来探索点心常规。重点是选择、触摸、闻、把食物放到盘子上，以及通过手势或常规参与来回应\"还要\"和\"全部完成\"。\n\n### Week 3: Hands, Face, Wash and Wipe｜第三周：手、脸、清洗和擦\n\n儿童把食物常规和卫生与照护连接起来。重点是洗手、擦嘴、展示手、通过真实照护常规识别干净／脏，以及安全使用布或湿巾。\n\n### Week 4: Snack Clean-Up and Care for Others｜第四周：点心收拾与照护他人\n\n儿童通过假装厨房、娃娃照护、摆桌、野餐游戏和收拾把食物、饮料、卫生和照护常规整合起来。重点是帮忙、给予、放置、擦和归位物品。"
    },
