      "en": "### Food and Drink Input\n\nwater ｜ milk ｜ snack ｜ apple ｜ banana ｜ cup ｜ spoon ｜ plate ｜ more ｜ all done ｜ apple, please ｜ banana, please ｜ drink water\n\n### Hygiene and Care Input\n\nhands ｜ face ｜ mouth ｜ wash ｜ wipe ｜ clean ｜ dirty ｜ show me your hands ｜ wash your hands ｜ wipe your mouth ｜ clean hands ｜ dirty hands\n\n### Action and Routine Input\n\nlook ｜ touch ｜ choose ｜ give ｜ take ｜ put ｜ drink ｜ eat ｜ wash ｜ wipe ｜ clean up ｜ wait ｜ your turn ｜ more ｜ all done\n\n### Teacher Routine Language\n\nSnack time. ｜ Drink water. ｜ Wash your hands. ｜ Show me your hands. ｜ Wipe your mouth. ｜ Give me your cup. ｜ Put it here. ｜ Put it on the plate. ｜ More? ｜ All done? ｜ Clean up. ｜ It’s dirty. ｜ It’s clean. ｜ Good job.",
